WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.959 --> 00:00:06.090
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and yesterday
in my trailer breakdown I asked you to submit

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.629
all of your game of thrones questions so I
picked 10 with one bonus one.

00:00:09.629 --> 00:00:14.550
I will say that the vast majority of the comments
were coldhands and story progression related.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:20.140
We’re also within two weeks of me beginning
my season 4 countdown series.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:25.089
So if there’s any special type of video
you want to see in that just let me know.

00:00:25.089 --> 00:00:29.189
If you’re finding me for the first time
be sure to subscribe to join the party.

00:00:29.189 --> 00:00:30.230
We have dragons.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:33.360
Let’s get to the questions.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:38.699
Careful for spoilers, I’ll try to answer
everything the best I can without being too

00:00:38.699 --> 00:00:39.730
explicit.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:46.329
Number 1 - Alice Cei asks Any chance we see
mention of the next big thing for the House

00:00:46.329 --> 00:00:47.329
Targaryen?

00:00:47.329 --> 00:00:49.260
I don’t think 10 episodes this season is
enough for that.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:53.600
I assume you’re talking about the big dance
with dragons plot point.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:58.579
I think it’s a strong possibility for season
5 depending on where they end season 4.

00:00:58.579 --> 00:01:04.519
There are several big moments this season,
so I think Dany or the targaryens or however

00:01:04.519 --> 00:01:08.380
you want to think of them, will only get two..

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:12.320
Question 2 - wadjiikhan (no avatar) asks Why
is it that whenever the dragons are shown

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:14.290
its always Drogon in the spotlight?

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:16.030
I like the other 2?

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:22.420
For a couple reasons, mostly because Drogon
is more of a character in the books.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:27.290
He’s tied specifically to a few really big
moments.

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:31.590
The other dragons have moments too, but Drogon
is like the lead singer of the dragon jam

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:32.590
band.

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:33.860
He’s the biggest and the baddest.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:38.720
The other reason is just from a cost perspective,
it’s super expensive to do special effects

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:41.490
for a dragon, especially a giant dragon.

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:51.000
So they try to show them as little as possible.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:55.180
Question 3 - StarPlat 7 asks Where will they
end this season at?

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:59.970
I think it will end on Dany just like season
3, logically the strong moment for them to

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:02.350
end on would be dany and drogon.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:06.290
If you want to know what that is and you don’t
care about spoilers, read dance with dragons

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:07.880
chapter 52.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:11.110
Other potential places they could end the
season would be with Jon Snow in dance with

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:14.070
dragons chapter 31 or chapter 69.

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:16.830
To be fair though, those are really towards
the end of the book.

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:20.780
There are several battles and major conflicts
all over westeros and in the east.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.781
Usually each season ends right after a great
victory or great defeat.

00:02:23.781 --> 00:02:25.490
So you could pick almost any of the big battles
as an end point.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:29.570
I don’t think they’ll make it through
all the book 4 and 5 material this season.

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:34.511
Question 4 - Andrew Jones asks Who is the
woman that we see burned during the Melisandre

00:02:34.511 --> 00:02:36.330
night fire scene?

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:39.400
A lot of people wondered whether this was
Brienne but it’s not.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:44.920
I would say it’s a wildling or someone from
Stannis’ own ranks given her age.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:49.320
Melisandre usually burns someone or something
of significance to provide magical aide to

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:50.480
stannis’ army.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:56.310
It looks like this happens before they sail
from dragonstone.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:03:01.580
Question 5 - andalib nizam asks Why do you
think Arya included Melisandre in her prayer?

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:05.590
Melisandre is the one who took gendry to be
sacrificed.

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:11.820
Remember arya got up in her face and she even
saw a little bit of arya’s future.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:15.040
It’s a very stabby future.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:20.690
Question 6 - ariadna quijano asks Shae will
have the same destiny as in the book?

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:25.150
There were a lot of Shae questions, so I’ll
try to answer all of them.

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:28.900
Yes shae will have more scenes, but based
on the way they teased us with the trailer

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:32.260
I think it will play out in a similar manner.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:35.840
Meaning the end result will be the same, but
shae will get a lot more story than she did

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:36.930
in the books.

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:44.440
Part of the issue with understanding her motivation
in book 4 was that she was barely part of

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.440
the story.

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:49.980
I think the show will try to expand on that
to make the why of it all a little more clear.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:54.070
Question 7 - Muhammad Hasir asks Does Jon
find out about rob?

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:55.420
Or bran?﻿

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:58.891
He learns about the Red Wedding because ravens
were sent everywhere, but he doesn’t know

00:03:58.891 --> 00:04:00.370
what happened to Bran.

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:09.060
Pretty much everyone assumes he was killed
by theon because they swapped the bodies when

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.880
winterfell was sacked.

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:17.940
Question 8 - Colin Coughtrey asks Do you think
I should read the books, will it improve or

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:21.290
lessen my experience of watching the show?

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:24.860
You should definitely read the books.

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:26.849
They’re just downright awesome.

00:04:26.849 --> 00:04:29.840
You don’t have to read them to follow the
show.

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:32.650
But if you like fantasy stories then yes.

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:43.949
If you start now, by the time you finish winds
of winter will probably be finished.

00:04:43.949 --> 00:04:47.870
Question 9 - The Warmonger asks Do you think
that the white walker at the end of the trailer

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:49.870
is cold hands?

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:54.520
So time to address all the coldhands questions.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:57.710
No I don’t think it’s the coldhands from
dance with dragons.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:00.270
Mostly because coldhands was not a white walker.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.729
And this person looks just like a white walker.

00:05:02.729 --> 00:05:05.740
Coldhands looked like a wight, which is a
reanimated corpse.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.180
So he looked more like a zombie.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:09.030
He also wore a deep hood.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:12.931
It’s possible that what the show is doing
is giving the cold hands part in the book

00:05:12.931 --> 00:05:14.389
to a regular white walker.

00:05:14.389 --> 00:05:18.830
They do mix things around a lot on the show,
but I don’t think we can call whoever this

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.419
is coldhands.

00:05:20.419 --> 00:05:26.419
I think he’s just a random white walker.

00:05:26.419 --> 00:05:30.530
Question 10 - Aimee Morris (no avatar) asks
do you think they'll run out of material for

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:34.210
season 5 and have to create new plots that
differ from the books?

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:38.639
Eventually yes, but not in the way you think.

00:05:38.639 --> 00:05:42.250
People ask george rr martin and the show runners
this question all the time.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:45.930
I think that winds of winter will be finished
by the time season 5 gets started next year.

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:49.520
But because they have to write all the stories
6 months ahead of time what will probably

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:53.530
happen is george rr martin will give them
an idea for how he wants the characters to

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:57.361
develop and some logical sign posts for the
plot and the show will just do it’s own

00:05:57.361 --> 00:05:59.150
things within those boundaries.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:06.180
So by the time we get to season 6, they’ll
go way off book.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:10.939
Because dream of spring probably won’t be
done until 2018 or 2019 given how long it

00:06:10.939 --> 00:06:11.939
took to write winds of winter.

00:06:11.939 --> 00:06:15.849
In interviews martin has also said that he
considers the show to have it’s own canon

00:06:15.849 --> 00:06:20.130
that’s unique from what he’s done in the
books or what he’s getting ready to do.

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:25.020
Bonus Question - footylova4evaa asks Did you
come across the books or tv show first?

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:29.190
I learned about the books in 2007, so I read
the first four books over the course of a

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:32.169
year or two and then waited till 2011 for
dance with dragons.

00:06:32.169 --> 00:06:33.580
And I haven’t re-read them since.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:37.659
I will refer to specific chapters if there’s
a question about a plot point though.

00:06:37.659 --> 00:06:44.259
But it’s been a couple years since i’ve
read them.

00:06:44.259 --> 00:06:47.379
Thanks so much for submitting questions everyone.

00:06:47.379 --> 00:06:49.139
This was a lot of fun like always.

00:06:49.139 --> 00:06:53.860
Unless they announce a new trailer or special
new footage for me to break down my next game

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:56.460
of thrones video will probably be my top 5
favorite characters from season 3.

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:57.949
Like i said, my big countdown series will
start in about two weeks.

00:06:57.949 --> 00:06:58.949
And it will have all kinds of different videos.

00:06:58.949 --> 00:07:01.930
Think of it as like when I did all the doctor
who videos around the 50th anniversary episode.

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:03.569
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:07:03.569 --> 00:07:08.199
Right now click here for all my season 4 breakdowns
and click here for my walking dead episode

00:07:08.199 --> 00:07:09.199
10 review.

00:07:09.199 --> 00:07:11.220
We finally found out what happened to baby
judith.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:14.090
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:14.969
High Fives!

